  "description": "Ring B distributed locking for the Goldpath enterprise asset: Medallion DistributedLock composed (Redis / Postgres advisory locks / SQL Server sp_getapplock) behind manifest-driven provider selection, with tenant-scoped lock names and acquire metrics. SQL Server support ships in the optional Goldpath.Locking.SqlServer package (its dependency chain carries Microsoft proprietary-but-free SqlClient native bits — only SQL Server choosers pay that). Locks reduce duplicate work; correctness comes from idempotency — the modules compose.",
